<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
P0090: Fuel Pressure Regulator1 Control Circuit / Open
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
High pressure fuel pump circuit is open.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(1 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" morerows = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
High pressure fuel pump and/or its circuit
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ECM
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "top" align = "left">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
P0091: Fuel Pressure Regulator1 Control Circuit Low
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
High pressure fuel pump circuit is shorted to ground.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(1 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1" valign = "top" align = "left">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
P0092: Fuel Pressure Regulator1 Control Circuit High
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
High pressure fuel pump circuit is shorted to power supply.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(1 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
